@startuml

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Player" as Player
participant ":System" as System

activate Player

    Player -> System : Requests list of available maps
    activate System

    System --> Player : Displays list of available maps

    System --> Player : Requests selected map

    Player -> System : Selects a map

    System --> Player : Displays selected map
    deactivate System

    Player -> System : Selects an *invalid* location for the station
    activate System

    System --> Player : displays error message: "Error. Oberbuilding is not allowed. Please, select another location"
    System --> Player : requests for valid location for the station

    Player -> System : Selects valid location for the station

    System --> Player : Requests station type (Depot, Station, Terminal)

    Player -> System : Provides station type

    System --> Player : Requests station's center (if the station requires it)

    Player -> System : Inserts station's center (NE,SE,NW,SW)

    System --> Player : Shows success message "Station created with success."
     System --> Player : Updates the map
    deactivate System

@enduml
